=========================================
IMPORTANT ENHANCEMENT
=========================================

Update PaymentEntity by adding

@ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY)
@JoinColumn(name = "journal_id")
private JournalEntity journal;

Purpose

Store the accounting journal created when the payment is posted.

-----------------------------------------

Update PaymentRefundEntity by adding

@ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY)
@JoinColumn(name = "refund_journal_id")
private JournalEntity refundJournal;

Purpose

Store the journal created when a refund is posted.

Business Rules

A payment should always reference the journal that created its accounting transaction.

A refund should always reference the journal that reversed the transaction.

These references will be used for

• Audit Trail

• General Ledger Drill-down

• Payment Details screen

• Journal navigation

• Duplicate journal prevention

